sequenceDiagram
    actor User as TalkBack user
    participant TB as TalkBack
    participant Sem as Semantics tree
    participant UI as App UI

    UI->>Sem: build semantics (descriptions, roles, state, headings, grouping)
    User->>TB: explore / swipe to next element
    TB->>Sem: query focused node
    Sem-->>TB: "Add to cart, button" or "Rating, 4 of 5, slider"
    TB-->>User: announces label + role + state
    User->>TB: activate (double-tap) / adjust (Switch Access)
    TB->>UI: perform action (click/toggle) via exposed accessibility action
    Note over UI: dynamic change -> liveRegion announces "Added to cart" without navigating
